cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DOX: Binocular CFP Ocular Disease Detection via RETFound Fine-tuning and Dual-Stream Feature Fusion"
abstract: >-
  A multi-label ocular disease detection framework that fine-tunes the
  RETFound foundation model with a hybrid Adapter-LoRA strategy
  (< 2 % trainable parameters) and a dual-stream binocular feature
  fusion module (DBFEM). Achieves 84.61 % AUC and 53.92 % F1-score
  on the ODIR-5K offline test set.
